Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1526-\n--\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1531-### POST /sections/:sectionId/members\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1532-private Section 접근 멤버 벌크 추가. **manager+ 전용 (D4)**. 그룹 프리셋을 쓰는 경우 **클라이언트가 group→flat `user_ids` 로 전개**해 전송한다(서버는 flat user_ids 만 받음 — 그룹은 접근 게이트가 아니라 편의 프리셋, design_intent.md §7-A).\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1533-\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1534-**Request**\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1535-```json\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1536-{ \"user_ids\": [\"uuid\", \"uuid\"] }\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1537-```\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1538-\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md:1539:> 각 `user_id` 는 해당 binder 의 활성 멤버여야 한다(서버 검증). 서버는 활성 `section_members`(`uq_section_members_active`) 를 upsert — 기존 tombstone 행은 `deleted_at=NULL` 로 부활, 신규는 INSERT. 리빙 propagation — 추가 즉시 그 Section 접근(§7-A(B)). `access_scope=0`(public) Section 에 호출 시 400(멤버십 개념 없음). editor·member 는 403.\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1540-\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1541-**Response 201**\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1542-```json\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1543-{ \"added_user_ids\": [\"uuid\"], \"member_count\": 6 }\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1544-```\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1545-\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1546----\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1547-\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1548-### DELETE /sections/:sectionId/members/:userId\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md:1549:private Section 접근 멤버 제거(tombstone). **manager+ 전용 (D4)**. 제거된 유저에게 `section_members` 삭제 tombstone 이 `user_id=me` 스코프로 전달되어 접근필터에 가려지지 않는다(AC1). 상실 Section purge 는 revoke 계약(§7-A(E)) 순서.\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1550-\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md:1551:> **마지막 멤버 제거 → 섹션 cascade soft delete (§7-A(C)-6·(F)):** 서버는 tombstone 후 활성 `section_members` 수를 트랜잭션 내 재계산하고, 0 이 되면 그 Section 을 cascade soft delete(메시지·리액션·멘션·embed·첨부·section_relation) 한다. 마지막 멤버는 관리자이므로 관리자 탈퇴=섹션 종료로 자연스럽다. **자동 public 전환 없음**(access_scope immutable, AC3). binder 탈퇴·강퇴에 의한 `section_members` tombstone 도 동일 규칙(마지막이면 섹션 종료).\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1552-\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1553-**Response 200**\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1554-```json\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1555-{ \"removed_user_id\": \"uuid\", \"member_count\": 3, \"section_deleted\": false }\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1556-```\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1557-> `section_deleted=true` 이면 마지막 멤버 제거로 섹션이 cascade soft delete 됨.\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1558-\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1559----\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1560-\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1561-### GET /binders/:binderId/groups\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md:1562:바인더 그룹(멤버 추가 프리셋) 목록. 멤버 전체 조회 가능(그룹명·컬러=식별 라벨). 그룹은 Section 접근 게이트가 아니라 **멤버 벌크 추가 프리셋** — 클라가 group→flat user_ids 로 전개해 `POST /sections/:id/members` 에 사용.\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1563-\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1564-**Response 200**\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1565-```json\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1566-{\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1567-  \"groups\": [\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1568-    {\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1569-      \"id\": \"uuid\",\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1570-      \"name\": \"string\",\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1571-      \"color\": \"string | null\",\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1572-      \"member_count\": 4\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1573-    }\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1574-  ]\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1575-}\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1576-```\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md:1577:> `linked_section_count` 폐지(그룹↔Section 링크 개념 소멸 — 2026-07-23). 프리셋 전개용 로스터는 `GET /groups/:groupId/members`(또는 그룹 상세) 로 조회.\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1578-\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1579----\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1580-\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1581-### POST /binders/:binderId/groups\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1582-그룹 생성. **manager+ 전용 (D4)** — editor·member 는 403.\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1583-\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1584-**Request**\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1585-```json\n--\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1600-{ \"name\": \"string\", \"color\": \"string | null\" }\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1601-```\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1602-\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1603-**Response 200**\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1604-\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1605----\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1606-\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1607-### DELETE /groups/:groupId\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md:1608:그룹(프리셋) 소프트 삭제. **manager+ 전용 (D4)**. 그룹은 접근 게이트가 아니므로 삭제해도 **기존 Section 접근에 영향 없음** — 이미 `section_members` 에 들어간 멤버는 그대로 유지된다(프리셋만 사라짐). 링크 FK 없음(구 `sections.group_id`·`primary_group_id` SET NULL 처리 소멸).\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/server/api.md-1609-\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projec