C-section-manage.md-578-\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md-579-**현재 코드**: createSection 는 RequestQueue 사용 (offline-first).\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md-580-**업데이트·삭제**: 정책 결정 필요 (§16-9) — Calendar 와 통일 권장 (offline-first).\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md-581-**private 생성·section_members mutation**: 서버 트랜잭션·인가 판정 필요 — online-first 검토 (§16-9).\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md-582-\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md-583-**Revoke 계약 (§7-A(E) — SC-sync 관할)**: revoke origin 은 `section_members` tombstone 단 하나. 접근 상실자에게 자기 `section_members` tombstone(`user_id=me` 스코프)이 콘텐츠 접근 필터에 가려지지 않고 도달(순환 필터 방지). 그룹 프리셋(`groups`·`group_members`)은 접근 게이트가 아니므로 revoke 순환 대상이 아니며 일반 binder 메타로 sync. Pull 당 적용 순서: ①ACL delta pull(자기 `section_members` tombstone/add + 그룹 프리셋 delta) → ②로컬 접근집합 재계산(access_scope·자기 section_members) → ③신규 접근 Section hydrate → ④상실 Section purge → ⑤잔여 콘텐츠 delta.\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md-584-\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md-585-Pull: `MessagingSyncHandler` 또는 `MetaSyncHandler` 에서 sections·section_members(`user_id=me` 스코프 + 접근-스코프 로스터) 처리.\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md-586-\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md-587-## 10. 권한 (정책 §16-1·§16-7 확정 전 안 + D3·D4 확정)\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md-588-\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md-589-| 액션 | master(0) | manager(1) | editor(2) | member(3) |\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md-590-|---|---|---|---|---|\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md-591-| 생성 (public) | ✓ | ✓ | (정책 §16-1) | — |\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md-592-| 생성 (private, 생성자 auto-add) | ✓ | ✓ | — (D4) | — |\n/Users/r